flowchart TD
  call[The model calls a tool] --> deny{Denied by a tool or category rule?}
  deny -- yes --> refused[Not run. The model reads why.]
  deny -- no --> grant{Already allowed by policy or a session grant?}
  grant -- yes --> run[The call runs]
  grant -- no --> mode{Access mode}
  mode -- Full access --> run
  mode -- Ask for approval --> card[Approval card]
  mode -- Auto --> review[A quick model reviews the call]
  review -- approves --> run
  review -- flags it, or fails --> card
  card -- you allow --> run
  card -- you deny --> refused
